* 5: Q2 emitter to Ground

* Transistors
Q1 3 2 1 NPN
Q2 2 4 1 NPN

* Current Source
I1 3 3 DC <DC value>

* Resistor
Rp 3 2 <Resistor value>

* Voltage Source (for Vb1 and Vin)
Vb1 2 1 DC <Voltage value>
Vin 4 1 DC <Voltage value>

* Vcc connection
Vcc 3 1 DC <Supply voltage value>

